units metal
dimension 3
boundary p p p
atom_style atomic
lattice fcc 3.52
region whole block 0 10 0 10 0 10
create_box 1 whole
create_atoms 1 box
replicate 10 10 10
pair_style eam
pair_coeff * * ../../../potentials/prompt1.potential Ni
velocity all create 600 4928459 mom yes rot yes dist gaussian
thermo 100
thermo_style custom step temp press
fix 1 all npt temp 300 2500 0.1 iso 1 1 1
timestep 0.001
run 2200
